config CONFIG_DUMP_RECORD_TIME
    bool "Dump Record Time"
    default n
    depends on !SOLUTION_CV18XX_BOOT
    help
      Print CV180x/CV181x FSBL, boot loader and application main timestamps
      in milliseconds. Applications call cvi_boot_time_record() at main entry
      and cvi_boot_time_dump() after console initialization. The early boot
      records wrap after 65.536 seconds; use a cold boot for comparisons.
      With FinSH/MSH enabled, the boottime command prints the saved snapshot.
